  "title": "Traditional Baba Ghanoush",
  "description": "This baba ghanoush recipe featuring baked eggplant, garlic, lemon juice, and tahini, plus a few pepper flakes for heat, can be served as a dip with pitas.",
  "authors": [
    "IMANKAY"
  ],
